@title Mega Man Zero 2 (USA)
@file Megaman Zero 2 (U).gba
@game A62E
@chip SRAM
@save skip: SRAM stays blank through the whole opening stage (desert, Pantheons, cliffs); the first save is at the Resistance base after this stage's boss, a wall-mounted cannon mechaniloid with three laser arms and no visible weak point, which killed Zero in every attempt in budget
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# New game, opening cutscene, then the desert stage: clear the Pantheon ambush
# (jump right over the one in front, turn, buster left), across the cliffs and
# gaps (wall jump up the second cliff), pick up the Cyber-elf Lybe, and walk
# into the boss arena (checkpoint boss after the boss's intro, Zero in control).
# Controls: A jump, B buster, L dash.
# Seen while authoring: the emulators run this game with different lag, so
# frames differ through most of the stage: during the opening scroll mgba is
# ahead (f4148 mgba shows the next cutscene panel, dingbat-bios and nba the
# previous one); in fights nba often shows Zero's hurt flash on frames where
# the other two do not (f5128, f7598, f8094 where nba also has an extra flying
# mechaniloid and a creature in the pit). The text "You got Lybe" is one
# glyph behind on nba (f8546). Inputs still line up: all three reach the
# boss with similar health.
[new]
wait 600
tap START times=1 every=30 hold=4
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 60
checkpoint main_menu window=30
press A
